  "notable_quotes": [
    "Out-of-alignment coordination sites between adjacent corrugated layers formed by bent ligands can be connected using a second ligand with a matching bent angle.",
    "CPM-63m and CPM-63a implement this design: Zn2 paddlewheels bridged by FDC2− form neutral kagome layers that are successfully pillared by bent MTZ− or ATZ− ligands.",
    "A double-bent-ligand strategy enables construction of pillar-layered MOFs with corrugated layers, addressing a common challenge for nonlinear and low-symmetry chiral ligands."
  ],
